# Upload only the shared package and the map container inputs. Dependencies, build output, tests and local config stay local.
*
!.dockerignore
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!shared/
!shared/**
!map/
!map/**
!agent/
!agent/**
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/test/
**/coverage/
shared/README.md
map/README.md
agent/README.md
map/infra/?*
!map/infra/dev-public-sources.json
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*service-account*.json
**/*credentials*.json
**/*.log*
